# Shared Purpose Leadership

Shared purpose is the third essential element of leader-led organizations, alongside physical space and social structure. A clear shared purpose unites employees toward common goals and cultivates a sense of belonging within an organization.

## Key Ideas
- Purpose provides direction that transcends individual tasks
- Shared purpose creates alignment without requiring micromanagement
- Purpose must be actively communicated and reinforced
- Organizations with clear purpose outperform those without

## Connection to Infinite Game Mindset
This concept aligns with [[infinite-game-mindset]], which emphasizes playing to keep playing rather than winning. Shared purpose is the organizational expression of that long-term, sustaining mindset.

